t have not been subjected to review.   n t  n(10)tEarnings per share is not annualised for the quarter ended 31 December 2019, 30 September 2019, 31 December 2018, nine months ended 31 December 2019 and 31 December 2018.  n t  n(11)tThe figures of the corresponding previous periods/year have been regrouped/reclassified, wherever necessary, to conform to the classification for the quarter and nine months ended 31 December 2019.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock>
